  1065	- **PROVED-HERE:** the 64 and 75 projected parent/bottom families survive with
  1066	  essential dimension two. The 75 multiplicity-one orbit is minor.
  1067	- **PROVED-HERE:** the 90 and 108 parent families survive; exact transitive
