xmodel/moh-source-three-questions-grok46-20260903.md:127:**Location.** Appendix I occupies p.202 (after the table) through p.207 (Prop A.5). **Appendix II. Some special cases** is p.207–211; p.212 is References. p.202: “The treatment of these four exceptional cases will be presented in Appendix II.” p.207 reprints them as degrees `(64, 68), (84, 56), (75, 50) and (99, 66)` — the known `(64,68)→(64,48)` erratum; the Prop 6.3 image is `(16,12) = (64,48)/4`, which pins `m = 48`.
