+# JET-EDGE-1612: one source-faithful common-jet edge
+
+Date: 2026-09-03  
+Lane: `jet-edge-1612-sol56-20260903`  
+Verdict: **SUCCESS[ONE-EDGE]**; the general `OPEN[SOURCE-JET-GLUING]` remains open.
+
+## 0. Result
+
+**PROVED-HERE.** On Moh's reduced ((16,12)) configuration, one common
+ramification (u=t^{1/4}) and the literal common ((\bar g,\bar f,h)) of
+printed p.208 give the exact (D_2\to D_1) transition
+
+\[
+\begin{aligned}
+ \operatorname{in}_{M}h&=-P^3,\\
+ \operatorname{in}_{M}\bar g&=P^{12}-c_1P^8+c_5P^4-c_{13},\\
+ \operatorname{in}_{M}\bar f&=-P^9+c_3P^5-c_9P.
+\end{aligned}                                                    \tag{0.1}
+\]
+
+This is formula (3.5), not a Taylor expansion of stripped parent (p,q).
+The five active nonleading entries are the common-jet variables
+((c_1,c_3,c_5,c_9,c_{13})). In particular
+
+\[
+ [P^8]\operatorname{in}_{M}\bar g=-c_1
+   =[X^8]G_5(X),                                                  \tag{0.2}
+\]
+
+so a lower child coefficient is determined by the retained parent/common jet.
+It is not determined by the parent leading polynomial alone.
+
+**PROVED-HERE.** For a primitive fourth root (zeta), the covariant
+uniformizer action (u\mapsto\zeta u) is
+
+\[
+ (P,P_*)^T\longmapsto
+ \begin{pmatrix}\zeta&0\\0&\zeta^3\end{pmatrix}(P,P_*)^T,       \tag{0.3}
+\]
+
+where (P) is the major-chart coordinate and (P_*) is the compatible
+minor-truncation coordinate. On
+((g_M,f_M,g_*,f_*)) the character matrix is
+(operatorname{diag}(1,\zeta,1,\zeta)). This supplies the action matrix
+missing from the charged sibling projection for this edge only.
+
+**EXACT-CAS.** Before elimination, (0.1) was mapped term-for-term to the
+charged report's ((64,48)) bottom prototype. The largest elimination used
+7 variables, 0.0042 s, and the process peak was 52,156 KiB under enforced
+caps of 30 variables, 600 s, and 2 GiB. The local saturated component is
+nonunit, both localization-negative controls are unit, and elimination
+recovers (+ho^2=6).
+
+**NOT CLAIMED.** This is neither a global ((\bar f,\bar g)) witness nor a
+new exit price, and the compatible minor chart is not promoted to a recursive
+minor-child ODE. Neither ((90,60)) nor (D=108) was run.
+
+## 1. Custody and literal source data
+
+**HASH-VERIFIED.** An `awk` stream generated from
+`xmodel/jet-edge-1612-sol56-20260903.run.v2` was passed directly to
+`sha256sum -c`; all 12 frozen files in `/tmp/jc2-lane.HTDIrG/inputs` returned
+`OK`. No digest was retyped. The two requested 200-dpi source renders are
+[printed p.208 / PDF 69](/home/ubuntu/jc2/box/jetedge-20260903/moh1983-printed-p208-pdf69.png)
+and [printed p.209 / PDF 70](/home/ubuntu/jc2/box/jetedge-20260903/moh1983-printed-p209-pdf70.png),
+with SHA-256 respectively
+`550934c22fe5e0412e5b7e478f805da40317ddb299eaacf03040fb9049b4f354`
+and `19bbfa56fd017c545219fadc51fcc1e515a7faedc3ec059913eccacf133928a9`.
+
+**SOURCE-READ.** Printed p.207/PDF 68 gives
+((n,m,M_2,V_2,\delta_2,\delta_1,J)=(16,12,13,3,-1,1/4,X)) and
+(t=x^{-1}). It prints the major chart
+(sigma=\pi t^{1/4}) and the minor chart
+(sigma^*=t^{-1}+a_0+a_1t+a_2t^2+\pi t^3). Printed p.208 replaces the
+latter, for the coherent calculation, by the compatible truncation
+
+\[
+ \bar\sigma=t^{-1}+a_0+a_1t+a_2t^2+\pi t^{11/4}.                \tag{1.1}
+\]
+
+It calls ({\sigma,\bar\sigma}) a coherent complete system for the same
+(ar g) and (ar f=\bar T_1), and prints
+
+\[
+ \bar g=h^4+\alpha_1h^3+\alpha_2h^2+\alpha_3h+\alpha_4,
+ \qquad \bar f=h^3+\beta_2h+\beta_3.                            \tag{1.2}
+\]
+
+Here (h) is literally called the fourth approximate root of (ar f), and
+
+\[
+\begin{gathered}
+ h=y^3(y-x)+b_1y^3+b_2y^2+b_3y+b_4=yA+b_4=y^2B+b_3y+b_4,\\
+ \alpha_2=c_1A+c_2,\quad \beta_2=c_3A+c_4,\\
+ \alpha_3=c_5A+c_5B+c_7,\quad \beta_3=c_8A+c_9B+c_{10},\\
+ \alpha_4=c_{11}A+c_{12}B+c_{13}(y-x).                         \tag{1.3}
+\end{gathered}
+\]
+
+**SOURCE-LITERAL / AUDIT DELTA.** The source repeats (c_5) in (alpha_3)
+and has no (c_6); that agrees with its immediate count of 17 coefficients.
+The frozen compiler instead models distinct (c_5,c_6) and absorbs
+(alpha_1) to explain 17
+([compiler lines 253–292](/tmp/jc2-lane.HTDIrG/inputs/appendix2-compiler-grok46-20260903.md:253)).
+No emendation was made here. `OPEN[PRINTED-C5-EMENDATION]` remains for any
+full-system reuse. It does not change (0.1): only the coefficient of (B)
+in (alpha_3) reaches the first major band, and that literal coefficient is
+(c_5).
+
+**TYPE SEPARATION.** (sigma), (sigma^*), and (ar\sigma) are three
+series roles; coherence is not an identification of their flags or physical
+places. The prefix symbols (a_1,a_2) in (1.1) are renamed
+`a1_prefix,a2_prefix` in the driver. Moh's later (a_i) in the p.209
+(eta)-Laurent display are not identified with them, and (eta) is not
+identified with (t).
