+**PROVED-HERE.** Work over
+$K_\zeta=\mathbf Q[\zeta]/(\zeta^2+1)$. Under the stated covariant convention,
+the moving exponents $1$ and $11\equiv3\bmod4$ prove (0.3). Both $h$ initials
+have character $\zeta^3$, both $f$ initials have character $\zeta$, and both
+$g$ initials are invariant. Parent $X$ is fixed because its exponent is
